{"seq":1,"slug":"y-combinator-model","title":"Y Combinator模式","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/core-contributions/y-combinator-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-new-model-for-startups","title":"创业孵化的新模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/core-contributions/y-combinator-model/a-new-model-for-startups","wordCount":2226,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"batch-and-community","title":"批次与社群","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/core-contributions/y-combinator-model/batch-and-community","wordCount":1833,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"y-combinator模式\">Y Combinator模式</h1><p>本章论述保罗·格雷厄姆通过Y Combinator所开创的创业孵化新模式。针对传统风险投资对早期创业公司支持不足的局限，Y Combinator以批次招募、标准化启动资金、密集指导、演示日等创新做法，为早期创业公司提供全方位的赋能。其中&quot;批次&quot;运作创造了独特的&quot;同辈&quot;效应，而强大的&quot;YC校友&quot;社群与信任互助的文化，则为创业者提供了持久的支持。本章呈现的，是格雷厄姆深刻改变创业孵化与早期投资格局的开创性模式。</p>\n"}